,35,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H002FıAAF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,0,8,10,10,80,1Style: Translation,Duality,65,&H002FıAAF,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,0,2,10,10,10,1Style: Kanji,Duality,65,&H002FıAAF,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,0,8,10,10,120,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, Text﻿[Script Info]; Script generated by Aegisub 3.2.2; http://www.aegisub.org/Title: Default Aegisub fileScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: TV.601PlayResX: 1280PlayResY: 720Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.04,0:01:57.05,Title,,0,0,0,,The Big Showdown on the Judicial Island!!Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.04,0:01:57.05,Title,,0,0,0,,The Big Showdown on the Judicial Island!!Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.05,0:02:00.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, but... please let me through.Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.65,0:02:04.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if you ask nicely...Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.93,0:02:08.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,no means... no!Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.15,0:02:16.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay. Then...Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.76,0:02:18.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,brace yourself!Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.65,0:02:19.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you, pirate?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.78,0:02:21.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.61,0:02:24.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ally Robot!Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.09,0:02:35.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! That's dirty!Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.13,0:02:36.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't attack him like that!Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.09,0:02:42.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's such an obvious trick! Don't hesitate!Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.22,0:02:47.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ally Robot... Punch!Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.87,0:02:49.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.48,0:02:53.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ally Robot... Kick!Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.87,0:02:58.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.03,0:02:59.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's enough!Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.89,0:03:02.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your back is wide open!Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.88,0:03:14.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.79,0:03:27.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring him down! It's just one unarmed man!Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.95,0:03:54.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's with his agility?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.01,0:03:55.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm in a hurry.Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.22,0:03:59.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,More people are coming later, so... See ya!Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.77,0:04:04.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.26,0:04:10.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey... stop!Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.65,0:04:13.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He got through! Hurry, get inside!Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.65,0:04:15.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He entered the main island!Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.74,0:04:17.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the island gate, reporting to the chief!Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.84,0:04:21.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,S-Straw Hat Luffy has entered the main island!Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.83,0:04:25.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! You let him enter the main island?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.31,0:04:27.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.28,0:04:28.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are Oimo and Kashi doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.97,0:04:31.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did those two get taken out, too?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.25,0:04:35.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, sir! Since it's the middle of the night...Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.09,0:04:37.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they're probably sleeping.Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.71,0:04:41.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is no time to be sleeping! Go wake them up!Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.05,0:04:43.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wake all of the guards sleeping on the main island, too!Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.67,0:04:45.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,R-Roger!Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.69,0:04:48.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's just an intruder.Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.98,0:04:52.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So it's not really a big deal, right, Chief?Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.61,0:04:55.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've got us.Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.86,0:04:59.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous! This is the Judicial Island,Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.65,0:05:02.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,which acts as a sacred symbol of  the entrance to the World Government.Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.55,0:05:09.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Any idiot should know what  it means to invade this place!Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.62,0:05:15.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And yet, he broke through to the main island  just to get one crew member back!Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.41,0:05:18.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's an embarrassment!  How dare they underestimate us!Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.89,0:05:22.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn those Straw Hats and their accomplices!Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.01,0:05:27.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gatekeeper! Explain what's going on at the main gate!Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.51,0:05:28.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, gatekeeper!Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.35,0:05:31.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How many enemies are there?Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.79,0:05:34.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are they?Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.89,0:05:37.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come in, main gate!Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.29,0:05:39.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the matter?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.51,0:05:43.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come in, gatekeeper!Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.57,0:05:47.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rope Action...Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.24,0:05:50.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Figure-of-Eight Knot!Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.37,0:05:53.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bazooka Bat!Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.17,0:05:58.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no need to waste ammo yet!Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.80,0:06:01.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go inside through the side  doors and open the gate!Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.59,0:06:07.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let them open it!Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.68,0:06:09.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get out of our way!Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.68,0:06:11.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mozu! Take the left side!Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.49,0:06:13.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got it!Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.87,0:06:15.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't let you!Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.34,0:06:18.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Hair is coming out of my nose!Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.99,0:06:20.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You should pay attention!Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.98,0:06:24.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.25,0:06:26.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks!Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.20,0:06:35.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keel Breaker!Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.65,0:06:46.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are the gates unlocked yet, Mozu, Kiwi?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.39,0:06:51.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ship demolition is the Franky Family's job. Picking locks like this is...Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.37,0:06:54.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This side is unlocked!Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.29,0:06:56.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This side, too!Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.47,0:07:01.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, then! Open the gate, Mighty Destroyers!Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.44,0:07:11.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let them open it!  Defend it at all costs!Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.64,0:07:13.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Move! You're in our way!Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.42,0:07:30.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rush in!Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.09,0:07:37.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We broke through the first gate!Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.57,0:07:44.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! What the hell is this hole?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.37,0:07:48.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever, don't pay any attention to it! Keep moving!Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.55,0:07:51.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just keep moving and  run towards the island gate!Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.54,0:07:53.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a waterfall!Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.49,0:07:58.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We did it!Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.33,0:08:00.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys! This way!Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.77,0:08:03.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give me a hand with this!Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.39,0:08:14.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kashi-san ! Oimo-san ! Get up right away!Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.67,0:08:18.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Th-The main gate has been forced open by intruders!Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.75,0:08:20.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.75,0:08:26.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He said the main gate was forced open, Oimo.Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.31,0:08:31.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. That's not good, Kashi.Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.39,0:08:37.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hate having to get up...Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.39,0:08:39.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But it's our job. Let's go.Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.13,0:08:51.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.85,0:09:12.78,Sign2,,0,0,0,,Kashi Gatekeeper of Enies Lobby's Island GateDialogue: 1,0:09:02.85,0:09:12.78,Sign2,,0,0,0,,Kashi Gatekeeper of Enies Lobby's Island GateDialogue: 0,0:09:02.85,0:09:12.78,Sign2,,0,0,0,,Oimo Gatekeeper of Enies Lobby's Island GateDialogue: 1,0:09:02.85,0:09:12.78,Sign2,,0,0,0,,Oimo Gatekeeper of Enies Lobby's Island GateDialogue: 0,0:09:05.21,0:09:07.59,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,I didn't get enough sleep.Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.44,0:09:11.59,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,I'm gonna quickly get rid of them, and go back to bed.Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.59,0:09:12.78,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,Same here.Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.78,0:09:15.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,G-G-Giants!Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.85,0:09:20.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you guys came all the way here for,Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.54,0:09:23.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I suggest you go home before we crush you.Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.57,0:09:24.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right, Oimo?Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.78,0:09:27.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Kashi. I think so, too.Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.14,0:09:31.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna squash you to your bones.Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.55,0:09:35.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Giant gatekeepers?! This isn't fair!Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.92,0:09:39.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're huge! They make our  Mighty Destroyers look tiny.Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.31,0:09:43.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, go back!Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.30,0:09:45.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let you through this gate!Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.22,0:09:46.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Me neither!Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.85,0:09:48.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're coming!Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.47,0:09:52.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter who we're up against,  don't flinch, Franky Family!Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.87,0:09:54.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is for Bro!Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.49,0:09:57.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.37,0:10:02.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you get it, right?Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.57,0:10:03.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.11,0:10:05.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right!Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.92,0:10:12.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we don't go, who will?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.29,0:10:17.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The super strength we gained working in ship  demolitions are a match for those giants!Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.72,0:10:19.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Destroyers!Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.35,0:10:45.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-Our Mighty Destroyers are...!Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.95,0:10:47.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In an instant...!Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.65,0:10:52.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're born warriors!Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.15,0:10:58.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The blood in our veins is different from that of small  humans who happen to be a bit bigger than others.Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.01,0:11:02.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let even a single person pass!Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.93,0:11:04.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't either!Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.77,0:11:14.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,D-D-Don't get cold feet! Don't give up!Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.63,0:11:18.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right! Big Bro Franky is on the other side of that gate!Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.79,0:11:27.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Show them a fight worthy of  Bro's name, Franky Family!Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.35,0:11:38.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hat Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.69,0:11:41.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How many friends did you bring?Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.09,0:11:46.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are 10,000 soldiers on Enies Lobby!Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.01,0:11:49.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm by myself.Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.17,0:11:57.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way!Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.93,0:12:05.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you don't give up and go back,Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.87,0:12:08.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we're gonna stomp on you!Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.53,0:12:24.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't flinch! Big Bro Franky is  on the other side of that gate!Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.65,0:12:36.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Show them a fight worthy of  Bro's name, Franky Family!Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.11,0:12:46.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't give in! Open the path for Rocketman!Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.27,0:12:54.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Break open the doors!Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.63,0:13:01.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're not gonna let even an ant pass through this gate!Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.35,0:13:09.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Destroyers!Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.76,0:13:10.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone!Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.93,0:13:15.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! How dare you bring down some of our strongest forces?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.81,0:13:17.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go!Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.11,0:13:26.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the...?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.29,0:13:28.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zambai!Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.42,0:13:29.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kiwi! Mozu!Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.84,0:13:31.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Galley-La!Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.71,0:13:37.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry we're late!Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.41,0:13:41.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It took longer than I thought it would to  switch Sodom and Gomorrah to land mode!Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.37,0:13:44.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zambai! The Destroyers are...Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.59,0:13:46.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know.Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.77,0:13:49.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have no time to patch them up right now.Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.70,0:13:55.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In order to get to where Bro is,  we have to open this gate at any cost!Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.29,0:14:05.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.99,0:14:07.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.89,0:14:13.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's make him lose his balance, Mozu!Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.10,0:14:14.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger, Kiwi!Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.75,0:14:25.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hull... Dismantler Slash!Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.71,0:14:30.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rope Action...Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.48,0:14:33.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Timber Hitch Tug!Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.02,0:14:38.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow, ow...!Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.03,0:14:47.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kashi!Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.95,0:14:54.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tilestone!Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.01,0:14:55.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.67,0:15:08.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow, ow...!Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.59,0:15:10.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Trunnel Lock!Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.27,0:15:11.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Work completed!Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.63,0:15:25.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bastards...!Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.94,0:15:28.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna crush you!Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.81,0:15:36.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kashi!Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.35,0:15:44.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right!Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.21,0:15:50.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you...!Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.39,0:15:54.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guys! Let's take the other one down!Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.09,0:15:56.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.53,0:16:05.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, what's the current situation?Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.21,0:16:10.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sir. Kashi and Oimo should be dealing with them right now, in front of the island gate.Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.87,0:16:12.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So I don't think there'll be any issues.Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.67,0:16:16.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. So, did you capture Straw Hat?  He's the one who infiltrated the main island.Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.98,0:16:19.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well... uh...Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.87,0:16:23.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...this is just an estimate, but it's about four hundred...Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.77,0:16:27.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Four hundred? What're you talking about?Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.13,0:16:29.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our casualties, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.95,0:16:38.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?! Our casualties?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.19,0:16:40.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that four hundred guards have been taken out?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.12,0:16:43.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looks like a hundred more are down...Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.45,0:16:46.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh, sorry. I need to revise that estimate.Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.75,0:16:49.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course you do! Our guards aren't trash or anything.Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.42,0:16:52.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll be damned if that many have been taken out!Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.28,0:16:55.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If there are casualties,  make sure you report them accurately!Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.83,0:17:04.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Er... well then, here is the report.Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.56,0:17:09.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The current casualties we have here are five-!Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.51,0:17:12.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Five are down?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.30,0:17:14.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So it was actually just five guards?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.55,0:17:18.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geez...You can't even make a report properly!Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.16,0:17:21.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Five... hundred...Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.59,0:17:27.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looks like Straw Hat Luffy isn't fighting,  he's just running around the island.Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.52,0:17:32.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, that's just natural. No one is stupid  enough to fight that many guards.Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.35,0:17:36.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's just a matter of time before he's captured.Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.59,0:17:39.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, sirs and madam.Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.57,0:17:44.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chief, Mr. Lucci and the others are here.Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.77,0:17:46.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're back?Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.89,0:17:48.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let them in!Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.63,0:17:52.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sogeking...Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.53,0:17:54.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.03,0:17:57.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, that hurt!Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.43,0:18:00.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How do you use this Tact for chilled air...Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.43,0:18:02.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm? Let me see...Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.43,0:18:04.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't ask me!Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.99,0:18:09.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, guys! It's time!Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.79,0:18:12.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go, shall we?Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.13,0:18:16.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They should've opened those two gates by now.Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.33,0:18:19.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Charge ahead! Charge ahead!Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.27,0:18:24.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Samurai-man! Take care of the iron fence!Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.67,0:18:26.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.21,0:18:39.05,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000  Timing: Galaxy 9000, Lance, PhosCity  Quality Control: Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Mr. Luffy, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Translation: CrunchyrollDialogue: 0,0:00:00.71,0:00:03.37,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get running, get runningDialogue: 0,0:00:03.59,0:00:06.46,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,holding our flag high in the skyDialogue: 0,0:00:12.77,0:00:18.06,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Cross this endless sea with me and search for Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.86,0:00:21.81,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,a global miracle no oneDialogue: 0,0:00:21.90,0:00:23.94,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,has yet been able to findDialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:27.96,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,With our hearts pounding,Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.96,0:00:29.71,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we'll just charge ahead as we please, following Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.71,0:00:35.59,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,the footprints of those who pursue their dreams Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.42,0:00:39.39,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,No matter how stormy the night,Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.39,0:00:42.39,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,if we put our minds together, Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.39,0:00:46.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we'll get through it Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.68,0:00:47.86,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,alwaysDialogue: 0,0:00:48.76,0:00:51.59,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get running, get runningDialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:54.55,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,holding our flag high in the skyDialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:57.14,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Even though there are tearsDialogue: 0,0:00:57.23,0:01:00.58,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we don't want anyone to seeDialogue: 0,0:01:00.77,0:01:03.52,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep chasing, keep chasing Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.69,0:01:06.52,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,the compass that leads to our dreams Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.61,0:01:09.23,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,always points straight ahead Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.23,0:01:11.40,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,We can't stop hereDialogue: 0,0:01:18.83,0:01:21.49,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get running, get running,Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.80,0:01:24.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,head past everyone elseDialogue: 0,0:01:24.63,0:01:27.12,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,So long as we don't run from it,Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.22,0:01:30.54,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we can take hold of tomorrow Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.60,0:01:33.63,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,Keep chasing, keep chasing Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:36.51,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,everything we see in the moment,Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:38.93,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,we should record it all Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.15,0:01:41.43,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,in the blank slates of our minds Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.52,0:01:41.62,Kanji,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HDialogue: 2,0:00:00.17,0:00:00.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 3,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.39,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,HaDialogue: 2,0:00:00.21,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,sDialogue: 2,0:00:00.24,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,hDialogue: 2,0:00:00.28,0:00:01.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 3,0:00:01.09,0:00:01.87,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,shiDialogue: 2,0:00:00.31,0:00:01.57,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 2,0:00:00.35,0:00:01.57,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00:01.57,0:00:02.03,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,riDialogue: 3,0:00